The runtime ships inside the ToolsEnabled Fleet plugin with its local
documentation. It does not contain a hosted service, agent CLI packages or
credentials. The agent CLIs Fleet starts, claude and codex, are installed
separately by the user.

The runtime declares no production npm dependencies. See
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md for the dependency inventory.
Fleet uses Node.js platform cryptography, including Ed25519 audit signatures.
